+# Plain HTTP for Internal Hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that HTTPS is required for all services, with no plaintext exceptions: plain HTTP is not permitted for any tier, including internal service-to-service communication, and there is no plaintext fallback (recorded 2026-09-26).
